{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/183886060dedcb6c0eeed16b347a945f.poster.avif?t=1766671429\" width=688 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/183886060dedcb6c0eeed16b347a945f.webm?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/183886060dedcb6c0eeed16b347a945f.mp4?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you like to immerse yourself in a cozy atmosphere with unobtrusive Lo-Fi music and express your creativity in home decoration? Go ahead!<br>\u00ad<br><strong>In our little game, you can:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00ad<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/d18baaccece2e5364713a02e2e13d236.poster.avif?t=1766671429\" width=688 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/d18baaccece2e5364713a02e2e13d236.webm?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/d18baaccece2e5364713a02e2e13d236.mp4?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various plants and other objects to decorate the house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorn the walls with different graffiti</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add stylish signs and control their lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the walls styles and adjust the building's height</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And even take control of the sun and weather!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And don't forget to simply admire the cherry blossoms \u231b</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/f733686b9497094304db556147b05730.poster.avif?t=1766671429\" width=688 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/f733686b9497094304db556147b05730.webm?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306140/extras/f733686b9497094304db556147b05730.mp4?t=1766671429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Man\u2019s best friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306140/d79bbe5c04e99c94fa37ea242d40cdba97746625.jpg"},{"name":"Closer to the stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306140/c6feb9905f127f4a8eeff615d691898ba26c9cfa.jpg"},{"name":"D\u00e9j\u00e0 Vu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306140/36d47bdaeb63e2cd6f4788b757590f430bd928b9.jpg"},{"name":"My neighbor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306140/d1ceb9a53020351533b3a746a76ece4b271062b2.jpg"},{"name":"Shine bright!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306140/5ecb295e8b49911737e623effa17dc83f2bfb30b.jpg"},{"name":"Green thumb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306140/2aae243a5e0afd06fb0999ddb90fd6a46aa006f8.jpg"},{"name":"Street artist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3306140/9d8a2bbf98904d294beb812ab467749606998e9b.jpg"},{"name":"A good start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamst